    rdfs:comment "A Medieval tower that was originally built in the twelfth century and is located near the crossroads of the present-day via Casilina and viale Palmiro Togliatti in the city of Rome.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/108334324> .

