<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/108889248%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Korčula Neolithic Site";
    rdfs:comment "A submerged neolithic site on a former islet connected to the east coast of Korcula island, just southeast of the modern town and port of the same name. Preliminary underwater excavations conducted by a team from the University of Zadar were reported in the media in 2021. Stone walls, ceramics, and tools were among the finds.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/108889248> .

