    dcterms:description "Representative locations of the Neo-Assyrian archive at Kalhu on the basis of Pedersén 1987 Plan(s) 66 and 69.";
    dcterms:modified "2022-10-10T09:28:38-04:00";
    dcterms:subject "ANE",
        "Assyrian";
    dcterms:title "Plan location of Kalhu Archive 10";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/116451894/plan-location-of-kalhu-archive-10> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/116472961%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tell Farukhabad";
    rdfs:comment "Settlement site in the Deh Luran Plain in Iran rich in pottery remains. The site has remains from the Chalcolithic, Uruk and Early Dynastic, Elamite, Parthian, and Sasanian periods.";
