    rdfs:label "via Taranto columbaria";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/423025%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Two Roman columbaria are located under the present via Pescara, 2. This accounts for the tomb being referred to interchangeably with two modern, street-derived toponyms, namely \"via Taranto\" and \"via Pescara\". These tombs are situated near the ancient crossroads of the via Latina and the via Labicana.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/116905947> .

