<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/118731%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Roman Heidelberg";
    rdfs:comment "A complex of Roman military structures was established and upgraded between the first and third centuries CE on the banks of the Neckar River in Germany where modern Heidelberg now stands. Forts, bridges, roads, and manufacturing facilities with attendant burials and inscriptions have been excavated.";
