<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/122145682%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Via Basiliano necropolis";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/272213280%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/423025%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient necropolis located in the modern Parco della Serenissima that was initially discovered via construction works in 1997. The necropolis is located, in ancient terms, in a landscape between the line of the via Collatina and that of the via Praenestina. The excavations also revealed traces of first-millennium BCE agricultural activity.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/122145682> .

