<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/13022744%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Spathari (temple)";
    rdfs:comment "A temple in Acarnania, located between Stratos (modern Sourovigli) and modern Lepenou. The temple seems to have been constructed in the Greek Archaic period on the site of an earlier Helladic settlement. The temple continued in operation into the Roman period.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/13022744> .

