<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148021%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Bois des Lens Quarries";
    rdfs:comment "A series of opencast limestone quarries located in the Bois des Lens about 25 km west of Nîmes (France) were identified and studied in the 20th century. They are thought to have been brought into use in the fourth century BCE, with peak exploitation occurring during the early Roman Empire.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148021> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148021/imagery-location-of-ign-representative-point> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:description "This representative point reflects the label anchor location used for the Bois des Lens on the IGN maps served through the French government's Géoportail website. It has been visually verified in Google Earth. Dates after Bessac.";
    dcterms:modified "2019-02-27T16:30:55-04:00";
    dcterms:title "Imagery Location of IGN Representative Point";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148021/imagery-location-of-ign-representative-point> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148022%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "La Brèche (necropolis)";
    rdfs:comment "A large necropolis excavated under rescue conditions in the 20th century. Grave goods indicated a long period of use, stretching from as early as the third century CE to as late as the sixteenth. The site is located in the French commune of Laudun-l'Ardoise, near the confluences of the Tave, Céze, and Rhône rivers.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148022> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148022/approximate-imagery-location-of-necropolis> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:description "Location determined in Google earth with reference to small-scale sketch map in Feugère 1987 (figure 1, page 81), which shows a dot near the confluence of the Tave and the Cèze rivers. BAtlas places the necropolis just south of the Tave. On page 81, the location is described only generally as \"sur la rive droite de la Céze\". Dates after Feugère.";
    dcterms:modified "2022-07-15T20:35:20-04:00";
    dcterms:title "Approximate imagery location of necropolis";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/148022/approximate-imagery-location-of-necropolis> .

