<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/151871520%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "La Cabañeta";
    rdfs:comment "A Roman-style settlement at modern El Burgo de Ebro, located on the south bank of the Ebro river, southeast of Zaragoza, Spain. The settlement appears to have been founded in the second century BCE and permanently destroyed in the first century, likely during the Sertorian War (82-72 BCE).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/151871520> .

