<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/198989301%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Temple complex at Kommos";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/589690%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Multi-phase temple site in the city of Kommos in southern Crete. Temple A was constructed by the late 11th century CE. A larger structure, Temple B, was built over it in the 9th century CE. The temple complex reached its maximum extent when Temple C was built over the site and its surroundings in the 7th century CE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/198989301> .

