    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/1001134%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/991381%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Karia was a geographic region of the Roman Empire whose territory belonged to the province of Asia. As a part of the Diocletianic reforms, Karia was subdivided into smaller units. It again became a separate province as part of the Diocese of Asia.";
