    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Da Riva and Wasserman 2025 pages 33, 36 with BM 34407 7′ (pp. 72-73), BM 40090+ r. iii 5 (pp. 78 and 83), and BM 43879 r. iv 19′ (pp. 96 and 99)";
