    dcterms:description "The province of Pontus became Diospontus in the Diocese of Pontus by 314. Following the death of Helena, mother of Constantine I, in 328 it was renamed Helenopontos. In 535/6 it was joined with Pontus Polemoniacus but retained the name Helenopontos.";
